        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5122ROU, Keyed Modern Round Knob with Square Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Keyed Knob with Square Rosette is available in an array of beautiful, contemporary finishes. Choose from favorites such as oil rubbed bronze, satin brass, and polished chrome. The Keyed Modern Round Knob with Square Rosette is actually available in two functions: a keyed entry function and a non-active dummy function. The keyed entry is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior. Easy to install, Emtek's Round Key in Knob with Square Rosette will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2-3/4 inch thick doors and has an optional latch to accommodate either a 2-3/4 inch or a 2-3/8 inch backset; this keyed entry set comes packaged with all the hardware you'll need. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Emtek Modern Round with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, keys, door latch, and strike plate.\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Keyed Knob with Square Rosette",
                "description": "The Modern Keyed Knob with Square Rosette is available in an array of beautiful, contemporary finishes. Choose from favorites such as oil rubbed bronze, satin brass, and polished chrome. The Keyed Modern Round Knob with Square Rosette is actually available in two functions: a keyed entry function and a non-active dummy function. The keyed entry is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior. Easy to install, Emtek's Round Key in Knob with Square Rosette will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2-3/4 inch thick doors and has an optional latch to accommodate either a 2-3/4 inch or a 2-3/8 inch backset; this keyed entry set comes packaged with all the hardware you'll need.",
